  "headline": "FDA's records show the shortage posted 2023-12-27 and a Class II recall by Curium US, LLC started 335 days later on 2024-11-26",
  "headline_cites": ["D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the shortage for Technetium TC-99M Pyrophosphate Kit Injection on 2023-12-27 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-16.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage has been on FDA's list for 34 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Class II recall by Curium US, LLC was initiated on 2024-11-26 for lack of assurance of sterility due to improper crimps on vials, 335 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recall involved Curium US, LLC and was terminated as of the report date 2025-01-01.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sun Pharmaceutical Industries, Inc. also has a Current shortage listing posted 2023-12-27 with estimated recovery TBD.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 22 vials providing 7.8 days on hand at current use.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from Cardinal Health 414, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
